{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"questions\":[{\"id\":\"f9a61d92-af4c-47b3-8fef-780b2a0869e4\",\"question_text\":{\"en\":\"Original Story 2: The Note in the Atlas\\n\\nWhile arranging returned books, librarian Farid found a note inside an old atlas: “Look where the river meets the road.” He first assumed it was a clue to hidden money, but the map showed no such place. Then he noticed a child waiting near the desk. She explained that the note was part of a geography game she had designed for her younger brother. Farid helped her replace the note and suggested adding page numbers so that the next clue would be easier to follow.\\n\\nQuestion: What was the note’s actual purpose?\",\"hi\":\"Original Story 2: The Note in the Atlas\\n\\nWhile arranging returned books, librarian Farid found a note inside an old atlas: “Look where the river meets the road.” He first assumed it was a clue to hidden money, but the map showed no such place. Then he noticed a child waiting near the desk. She explained that the note was part of a geography game she had designed for her younger brother. Farid helped her replace the note and suggested adding page numbers so that the next clue would be easier to follow.\\n\\nQuestion: What was the note’s actual purpose?\"},\"options\":{\"A\":{\"en\":\"It marked a construction site.\",\"hi\":\"It marked a construction site.\"},\"B\":{\"en\":\"It recorded a library fine.\",\"hi\":\"It recorded a library fine.\"},\"C\":{\"en\":\"It was part of a geography game.\",\"hi\":\"It was part of a geography game.\"},\"D\":{\"en\":\"It gave directions to Farid’s home.\",\"hi\":\"It gave directions to Farid’s home.\"}},\"difficulty\":\"intermediate\",\"source\":\"QuestionWale Original | Verified: SSC CGL English — Simple Passage Based on a Book or Story\",\"source_metadata\":null,\"year\":null,\"pyq_exam_name\":null,\"exam_tags\":[\"SSC\"],\"attempt_count\":0,\"correct_count\":0},{\"id\":\"f195e72d-7607-4b44-9c1a-681fa86e0421\",\"question_text\":{